'Installed new Eppley Sensor update multiplier from 
'previous 9.93 to new 8.13.
'
'
'Version: 4 August 17, 2015 - Jacob Davis, CSI
'    Wholesale renaming of solar radiation variables.
'     As they were called      	New Label       	Indicates
'         EppPSP1	            SWDN	       Short Wave Down/Incoming

' Updated the Vertical Wind Measurement Multiplier to 
' Account for the Cosine Measurement Effect Factor 1.25. (0.0225).
' Corrected the W/m2 multiplier for solar sensor meassurement 
' from 1E5 to 1E6 & also updated sensor multiplier to current value.
'
'
